# Deployment configuration for script/Deploy.s.sol.
# Copy to .env, fill in, and `source .env` (or use `--env-file .env` with forge) before running
# the deployment script. Never commit the real .env file — it stays out of Git via .gitignore.

# ── Local Anvil (default target for Stage 6B) ────────────────────────────────
# Anvil's own well-known, publicly-documented default dev-mnemonic key (account #0 of
# "test test test test test test test test test test test junk"). This key is identical on
# every Anvil instance in existence and protects nothing of value — it is safe to use verbatim
# for local development, but must NEVER be used against a real network.
RPC_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8545
PRIVATE_KEY=0xac0974bec39a17e36ba4a6b4d238ff944bacb478cbed5efcae784d7bf4f2ff80

# ── Testnet (not used yet — Stage 6B is local-Anvil only) ───────────────────
# RPC_URL=<your testnet RPC endpoint>
# PRIVATE_KEY=<a real deployer key, supplied only via your local shell environment or a secrets
#   manager — never write a real key into this file or any file that gets committed>
